TI  - Nannochloropsis oceanica IMET1 and its bacterial symbionts for carbon capture, utilization, and storage: biomass and calcium carbonate production under high pH and high alkalinity
T2  - APPLIED AND ENVIRONMENTAL MICROBIOLOGY
