TI  - Carbon sequestration and physiological conditions of Kappaphycus Alvarezii: Toward sustainable seaweed cultivation in coastal waters of Mattirobaji Village, Takalar, South Sulawesi, Indonesia
T2  - EGYPTIAN JOURNAL OF AQUATIC RESEARCH
