TI  - Incorporating blue carbon sequestration benefits into sub-national climate policies
T2  - GLOBAL ENVIRONMENTAL CHANGE-HUMAN AND POLICY DIMENSIONS
LA  - English
KW  - Ecosystem services
KW  - Climate mitigation
