TI  - Experimental development of a biological photovoltaic cell (BPV) for energy conversion and simultaneous CO2 capture by utilizing marine microalgae on copper mesh
T2  - RENEWABLE ENERGY
LA  - English
KW  - Biological photovoltaic cell
KW  - Carbon capture
