TI  - Dual-Carbon Flow Life Cycle Assessment of Mussel Aquaculture in Shengsi, Zhejiang: Decoding the Carbon Footprint of China's Largest Mussel Production Base
T2  - SUSTAINABILITY
LA  - English
KW  - carbon footprint
KW  - life cycle assessment
KW  - bivalve
KW  - mussel
