TI  - Seaweed (Porphyra) cultivation enhances production of autochthonous refractory dissolved organic matter in coastal ecosystems
T2  - FRONTIERS IN MARINE SCIENCE
LA  - English
KW  - <italic>Porphyra</italic>
KW  - coastal cultivation zone
