TI  - Seasonal bloom alternation drives periodic shifts in carbon sink function via differential dissolved organic matter processing in a plateau lake
T2  - WATER RESEARCH
LA  - English
KW  - Dissolved organic matter
KW  - Algal blooms
KW  - Meta-metabolome
KW  - Microbial carbon pump
KW  - Refractory dissolved organic carbon
